# --- 研究原始材料 -----------------------------------------------------------
# 保留：search-results/*.json、claims.json、quote-verification.csv、
# extraction-report.json、metrics.json、qa-check.json、source/claim ledgers。
# 不保留：PDF 全文、逐页文本、数据库缓存、抓取日志。
**/research/downloads/
**/research/fulltext/
**/research/**/*.pdf
**/research/**/*.sqlite3
**/research/**/*.db
**/research/**/*.stderr.txt

# --- Episode 布局（00_raw_materials / 01_research / 03_slides / 04_manim_src）---
**/00_raw_materials/**/*.pdf
**/00_raw_materials/**/*.epub
**/01_research/downloads/
**/01_research/fulltext/
**/03_slides/public/*.mp4
**/03_slides/public/*.webm
**/03_slides/public/*.wav
**/03_slides/public/*.mp3
**/04_manim_src/media/

# --- QA / 浏览器 / 渲染中间产物 --------------------------------------------
**/qa/chrome-profile*/
**/qa/chrome-profile-test*/
**/qa/rendered-frames/
playwright-report/
test-results/

